3
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:17,800
FLOW GLOW 2周年 おめでとうー！
Happy 2nd anniversary, FLOW GLOW!

4
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:22,000
イェーイ！
Yeah!

5
00:02:22,100 --> 00:02:23,700
2周年だよー！
It's our second anniversary!

6
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:25,200
2周年！
Second anniversary!

7
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:27,000
え？ え？
Huh? What?

8
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:29,000
もう1回やって、もう1回やって。
Do it again, do it again!

9
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:29,800
何それ？
What is that?

10
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:32,200
やめてー！
Stop it!

11
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,800
だっせぇ！ 何それー！
That's so lame! What is that?!

12
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:35,800
何それ？ 本当に...
What is that? Seriously...

13
00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:38,200
何やらせてんだよ、こいつに！
What are you making her do?!

14
00:02:38,300 --> 00:02:40,800
やらせてって... 隣でやるからー！
Making her...? I'll do it right next to her!

15
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:46,800
はい、ということでね、応援してくださってる皆様のおかげで、今日を迎えることができました！
All right! Thanks to everyone who has been supporting us, we're able to celebrate this day!

16
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:53,000
今日はもっともっとFLOW GLOWのことを好きになってもらえるような、そんな日になればいいなって思います！
I hope today will be a day that makes you love FLOW GLOW even more!

17
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:58,300
後半にはライブパートもあるので、最後まで見逃さないでねー！
We've got a live concert in the second half, so make sure not to miss a thing until the very end!

18
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:02,500
イェーイ！ 見逃すなー！
Yeah! Don't miss it!

19
00:03:02,500 --> 00:03:05,000
見逃さないで...
Don't miss it...

20
00:03:04,500 --> 00:03:07,500
話聞いてなかった。 聞いてなかったな。
They weren't listening to you. Yeah, totally tuned out.

21
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:12,800
聞いてなかったな。まぁ早速なんですけど、去年みんなでね...
They really weren't. Well, jumping right in, last year we all...

22
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:15,000
バンジージャンプのロケ...
...went on a shoot for bungee jumping...

23
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:16,800
それ今言うの？ ロケ飛んだな！ 今通った。
You're bringing that up now? We totally did that shoot! Passed right through.

24
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:20,500
でね、今年も...ロケ行ってきちゃいましたー！
And so, this year too... we went on location!

25
00:03:20,500 --> 00:03:23,000
イェーイ！
Yeah!

26
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:25,000
気づいたらみんな行ってたのね。
Before we knew it, everyone had gone.

27
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:28,800
どこに行ったかね、フロアミのみんなは分かるかなー？
Do you Flowmis know where we went?

28
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:31,000
分かるかなー？ なんて書いてる？
Wonder if they know? What is chat saying?

29
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:35,000
「イェーイ」だ、まだ。 「おめでとう」って。
They're still saying "Yeah!" Saying "Congrats!"

30
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:37,000
みんな言ったか？
Did everyone guess?

31
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:40,000
あ、今、今違うかも。まだたどり着いてない。
Ah, right now might be off due to delay. They haven't reached this part yet.

32
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:42,500
今多分バンジーの話やね、これね。
Right now they're probably on the bungee jumping part.

33
00:03:42,500 --> 00:03:44,800
飛べー！
Jump!

34
00:03:46,500 --> 00:03:50,000
あ、「どこ行ったかな、どこだろうな」って言ってる。
Ah, they're saying, "Where did they go? Where could it be?"

35
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:53,000
お、お？ 温泉？ 温泉か？
Oh, oh? Hot springs? Hot springs?!

36
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,200
去年言ってたもんね、「温泉行きたい」って。
We did say we wanted to go to hot springs last year!

37
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:57,200
見たいってこと？俺らが温泉入ってるところ。
You mean you wanna watch us soaking in a hot spring?

38
00:03:57,200 --> 00:03:59,000
いやらしい！
How scandalous!

39
00:03:58,500 --> 00:04:00,800
絶対にさ、当たりを言わないじゃん！
There's no way they'd guess the right answer!

40
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:02,000
北極？
The North Pole?

41
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:05,500
しかもさ、「嫌だ」って言った時さ、ここシンクロして「嫌だ」。
And you know, when they said "No way", the two over there synchronized with "No way".

42
00:04:05,500 --> 00:04:07,500
嫌だ〜！
No way~!

43
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:10,500
全然嫌がってないやん！
You're not disgusted at all!

44
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:15,500
さぁ、私たち2周年は何をしてきたのか？
Now, what did we actually do for our 2nd anniversary?

45
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:18,500
VTR...

46
00:04:18,500 --> 00:04:20,200
来た来た来た...
Here it comes, here it comes...

47
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:21,800
スタート！
Start!

48
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,200
何やってんだよ！
What are you doing?!

49
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:26,800
[Text: 2026年 某日]
[Text: Sometime in 2026]

50
00:04:27,500 --> 00:04:32,000
行くでー！ 行こう！ やばーい！
Let's go! Let's go! This is amazing!

51
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:37,000
FLOW GLOW 2周年 in 沖縄ー！
FLOW GLOW 2nd Anniversary in Okinawa!

52
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:39,000
イェーイ！
Yeah!

53
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:41,200
海だ〜！！！
It's the ocean~!!!

54
00:04:40,500 --> 00:04:42,000
海、海！
The ocean, the ocean!

55
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,800
めっちゃ晴れたくね？ 晴れた！
Isn't it super sunny? It is!

56
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:47,500
なんくるないさ〜！
Nankurunaisa~!

57
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:54,500
今回の2周年、このあとのライブでは、かっこいいダンスと、かっこいい歌と、かっこいいFGを魅せる...
For this 2nd anniversary, in the concert coming up next, we'll show you cool dancing, cool singing, and a totally cool FG...

58
00:04:54,500 --> 00:04:56,000
おおー！
Ooh!

