紐？！
Strings?!

95
00:06:31,808 --> 00:06:33,808
でも紐着たいな〜
I wanna wear strings though~

96
00:06:33,608 --> 00:06:35,008
いいじゃん
Sounds good.

97
00:06:34,808 --> 00:06:36,008
引っ張っていい？
Can I pull them?

98
00:06:35,908 --> 00:06:37,208
引っ張るな！
Don't pull them!

99
00:06:36,808 --> 00:06:38,008
引っ張らせて
Let me pull them.

100
00:06:37,808 --> 00:06:39,808
OKなわけあるか！
Like hell that's okay!

101
00:06:40,008 --> 00:06:41,708
もうすぐ着くね〜
We're almost there~

102
00:06:41,508 --> 00:06:43,008
だからさ〜
That's why~

103
00:06:41,808 --> 00:06:44,008
[Sign: 最初の目的地に到着]
[Sign: Arrived at First Destination]

104
00:06:44,608 --> 00:06:47,508
あの青い船らしいぞ
Looks like it's that blue boat over there.

105
00:06:45,008 --> 00:06:52,508
[Sign: カイザーマリンクラブ / 世界屈指の透明度を誇る「ケラマブルー」の海で色々なマリンアクティビティを体験できる]
[Sign: Kaiser Marine Club / Experience various marine activities in the "Kerama Blue" waters, boasting world-class clarity]

106
00:06:47,008 --> 00:06:48,208
え、青いやつ？
Wait, the blue one?

107
00:06:48,208 --> 00:06:52,508
出発進行〜！
All aboard~!

108
00:06:49,508 --> 00:06:52,508
進行〜！
Full steam ahead~!

109
00:06:53,008 --> 00:06:55,508
風が気持ちいいね
The breeze feels so nice.

110
